  "details": "I don't play that often anymore, but this started happening when I build my new PC with a Intel system. The output log gets spammed with a ton of items. \n\nIt seems to have to do something with my VPN and being unable to reach one of the VRC servers. I can see people, move, load images, hear voices so everything seems functionally fine that I can see. But the game is unable to reach some server so it's spamming the logs over and over. \n\nIf I turn off my VPN and go raw, it goes away. This has never happened before, if the client was unable to reach something due to the VPN, it would just not function. But now it's causing a huge spam in my log and making the game unplayable.",
